              lost answer, a refused storage write, disposal, and the rest of the catalogue's grid) is driven once with
              the usual profile until a write reaches that phase, then given that fault, with the run rules applied;
              unreachable pairs are counted and named. The pair sweep is the deterministic floor of the test gate;
              random stress seeds add breadth, with a fixed seed list in the gate and more outside it.
